{"seq":36,"slug":"release-engineering","title":"发布工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"发布工程-让软件变更安全-可控-可重复地到达用户\">发布工程：让软件变更安全、可控、可重复地到达用户</h1><p>发布工程（Release Engineering）是将构建产物从代码仓库安全推送到生产环境的系统性工程学科。它不是简单的&quot;点击部署按钮&quot;，而是一套涵盖策略设计、流量控制、安全门禁和组织协同的完整方法论。在持续交付已成基线的 2026 年，真正的挑战从&quot;能不能部署&quot;转向了&quot;如何在高频发布中持续保持质量与稳定性&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-解决什么问题\">本 hub 解决什么问题</h2><p>从三年经验的工程师视角出发，你可能已经熟悉 CI/CD 流水线的搭建，但面对以下问题可能缺乏系统方案：灰度发布的流量比例怎么定、金丝雀指标异常时该回滚还是前滚、Feature Flag 的技术债如何治理、发布频率如何匹配团队节奏。本 hub 用 4 章 12 篇文档逐一拆解这些问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第 1 章：发布工程基础</strong> — 发布工程的核心概念、策略模式和流水线架构</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章：渐进式发布</strong> — Feature Flag 工程化、金丝雀/蓝绿部署、流量塑形与分级发布</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章：发布安全与门禁</strong> — 质量信号门控、回滚/前滚决策、发布事故响应</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章：发布效能优化</strong> — 发布节奏设计、可观测性建设、发布文化与组织</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 hub 的边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>devops-sre</strong>：侧重基础设施即代码、监控告警和值班体系；本 hub 聚焦发布这一环节的策略与流控设计</li>\n<li><strong>developer-experience-metrics</strong>：度量开发者效率的方法论；本 hub 虽引用 DORA 指标但重点在发布流程本身而非度量框架搭建</li>\n<li><strong>ci-cd-pipeline</strong>：关注流水线工具链搭建（Jenkins/GitHub Actions/ArgoCD）；本 hub 假设你已有可用流水线，侧重其上的发布策略层</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按章节顺序阅读。第 1 章建立概念地图，第 2 章掌握渐进式发布的核心手法，第 3 章学习风险兜底机制，第 4 章提升组织层面的发布效能。如果你已有金丝雀部署经验，可直接从第 3 章开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>理解 CI/CD 基本流程（代码提交→构建→测试→部署）</li>\n<li>熟悉容器化部署（Docker/Kubernetes 基础概念）</li>\n<li>了解基本的监控与告警概念（指标采集、阈值告警）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第 1 章：发布工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-engineering-overview","title":"发布工程概述与核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/foundations/release-engineering-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-strategy-patterns","title":"发布策略模式与选型决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/foundations/release-strategy-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-pipeline-architecture","title":"发布流水线架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/foundations/release-pipeline-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"progressive-delivery","title":"第 2 章：渐进式发布","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-flags-engineering","title":"Feature Flag 工程化管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/feature-flags-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"canary-bluegreen-deployment","title":"金丝雀与蓝绿部署的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/canary-bluegreen-deployment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"traffic-shaping-rollout","title":"流量塑形与分级发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/traffic-shaping-rollout"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-gates","title":"第 3 章：发布安全与门禁","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-gates-quality-signals","title":"发布门禁与质量信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/release-gates-quality-signals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-rollforward-decisions","title":"回滚与前滚决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/rollback-rollforward-decisions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-incident-response","title":"发布事故响应与复盘机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/release-incident-response"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"optimization","title":"第 4 章：发布效能优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-frequency-cadence","title":"发布频率与节奏设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-frequency-cadence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-observability","title":"发布可观测性体系建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-culture-organization","title":"发布文化与组织能力建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-culture-organization"}]}]}